# Artificial Evolution changes the text of Seasoned Dungeoneer, Warrior to Goblin (CR 612.1). It is a Human Goblin now
# (the type line follows the text), so when it attacks, its trigger's "target attacking Cleric, Rogue, Goblin, or
# Wizard" can target it: it explores (CR 701.44) and the land on top of the library goes to Bot1's hand. Read as
# printed, no creature would be a legal target and the trigger would do nothing.

